 push verification, number matching, SOS remote assistance, TOTP, and
 zero-trust security posture telemetry.
 Fully compatible with Astra Linux Special Edition / Common Edition,
 RED OS (РЕД ОС), Alt Linux (Альт Линукс), Debian, and Ubuntu.
